":"Zhemirkes Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Westen Spirits."},{"id":"marker209","name":"Qunidoni Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Schwarzen Druidism."},{"id":"marker210","name":"Milke Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Guantzu Totems."},{"id":"marker211","name":"Sargargun Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Schwarzen Druidism."},{"id":"marker212","name":"Nergal Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Guantzu Totems."},{"id":"marker213","name":"Minmillgemut Hyenas","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker214","name":"Utugigingai Dogs","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker215","name":"Vintulengol Hawks","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker216","name":"Whimug Tigers","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker217","name":"Medmilia Bears","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker218","name":"Croerynegl Rats","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker219","name":"Sancheongam Ravens","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker220","name":"Tratis Cats","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker221","name":"Vušebálo Snakes","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker222","name":"Sitechalu Spiders","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker223","name":"Verdo Ravens","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker224","name":"Antra Owls","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker225","name":"Vladrástov Hawks","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker226","name":"Tököchü Ravens","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker227","name":"Leukua Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༯༄༽༄༯༓༘༽༩༔༩༉༛༵༡༜༼༚༉༊༒༄༒༣༭༷༗༬༆༵༓༤༧༷༥༲༿༚༂༦༩༵༤༵༩༁༙༗་༳༇༑༻༻༾༁༻</div>"},{"id":"marker228","name":"Chang Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc20𐠤\ud802\ud802𐠁\ud802𐠔\udc3f𐠱𐠍\ud802𐠖𐠡\ud802𐠪\udc3f\udc0c\udc28𐠢\udc02\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc05𐠍𐠞\udc1a\udc16\udc25𐠁\udc31\udc20\udc15\ud802𐠌\udc22𐠘\udc0f𐠍\udc35\udc3f\udc2d\ud802\ud802 𐠧𐠸\udc30\udc1e\udc1a\udc14\ud802\ud802𐠁\ud802𐠥𐠙\udc2f\udc24\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠗𐠗𐠢𐠕\ud802𐠳\udc28 </div>"},{"id":"marker229","name":"Chang Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠭\ud802𐠟𐠯𐠓𐠛\udc03\ud802𐠁𐠧𐠧\udc02\udc3c 𐠎 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠙\udc1a\udc2a𐠁𐠨\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc1c\ud802\ud802𐠚𐠸\udc15\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker230","name":"Shat Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠱᠰᡆᡏᡍᡍᢑᡲᢓᡳᠲᢀᢠᠩᡙᢡᡮᡮᠻ᠀ᡒᢞ᠀᠑ᡑ᠒ᡡᠳᠲᡙᡳᡟᠨᡭᡳᡴᡜᡝᢒᢛᡁᠯᡭ᠐ᢋᡑᡏᢐᡔᢋᢟᢏᠳᡑᡏᡜᢑᡟᢋᡆᡎᡳᡱᢐᠩᢟᠧᡜᢒ᠑ᡝᢠᠼᠲᠼᡁᢟᠠᠩᠾᠮᢁᡡᢡᡗᢐᠽᡆᠻᡡᡆᠿᠡᡓᡞᢀᡱᡍᠭ</div>"},{"id":"marker231","name":"Stętostov Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠽᠪᠭᠨᡐᡙᢠᡁᠳᡳᡖᠲᠵᡙᠪᠰᠱᡗᠭᡍ᠐ᠱᡐᢐᡝᡟᠳᡜᠨᡎᡓᡳᡞᡠᢑᡰᠮᡰᡠᡆ᠐ᠲᢓᢜᡁᡡᢋᡴᢤᠽᢠᢐ</div>"},{"id":"marker232","name":"Huranfair Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc17\udc27\udc19\ud802\ud802 𐠴𐠚\udc05𐠭\udc1b\ud802 \udc0a\udc0a\udc30\udc0c \udc15\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠼\udc01  \udc19\udc2e\udc22𐠐𐠿\udc2f\ud802\ud802𐠥 \udc15</div>"},{"id":"marker233","name":"Weidriglyn Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳔⲼⳀⲸⳲⳢ⳩ⳢⳤⲼⳭ ⳲⳐⲶⳭⳐⳭⲼ ⳫⳎⳜ⳧ⳎⳫⳎⳘⳁ⳹ⳌⳁⳁⳈⳔⳊ⳥Ⳟ⳥  Ⲽ⳪ⲶⲶⳌⳊⳖⲺⳞ⳥Ⳉ Ⳗ⳩ⲺⳞⳠ</div>"},{"id":"marker234","name":"Čászecie Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠭᡙᠾᠠᠪᠯᡓ᠒ᠦᡕᢤᢀᡁᡁᡏᠦᠦᡎᡑᡙᢜᢑᢋᡞᢁᡡᠱᡓᡞᠭᡟᠪᠨᢥᡱᡰ᠐ᢥᠩᡠᡗᡖᢜᠨᢁᡱᠿᡙᢒᢒᢀᡰᡭᡖᡯᡱᢓᡳᢀᡗ</div>"},{"id":"marker235","name":"Guqamashar Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሐፈጰ ሐፐፐጸፀዘከጸሠረኀተወመአወገ  ጰሰኀሰበ መበተበየጸዘደረኀዐተሐከየተአተ ረሀፀቀበወጠቀ ሠደጸሐ  ዘበነዐየፀደለ ተገፈከጸደዐዐከ መተ ጠየዘረሀጸ ጰፀተፈዘገረ</div>"},{"id":"marker236","name":"Tirostokle Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༢༿༰༤༆༚༱༚༊༮༬༼༡༯༨་༷༒༽༆༄༳༅༿༕༊༵༬༢༇༵༲༲༯༕༸༦༦༧༲༖༽༇༁༘༒༊༗༯༂༺༵༜༥༒༆༛་༬་༰༔༩༽༃༪༁༴༫༒་༥༓༁༼༱༬༤</div>"},{"id":"marker237","name":"Legrad Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠩᢓᡆᡓᢠᠲᡑᠯᡜᡒᠳᡳᡁᡗᡝᠿᡰᢏᢓᠼᡟᢒᡟᡱᠨᡞᠩᠡᡮᠡᢞᠦᡙᠦᡕᠵᠮᠭᢁᠻᡐᢋᢓᠨᡐᡙᡏ᠑ᢡᠰᢥᢜᠻᠪᠪᡍᠲᠱᠾᡝᠠᡆᠩᠪᠳᠰᢞᡰᠽ</div>"},{"id":"marker238","name":"Soměříž Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡒᡆᡎᡒᡒᡭᠮᡏᠳᡴᡲ᠒᠐ᢐᡒᢤᡠᢦᡙᠻᡕᠰᠵᢁᢡᠿᢢᠼᢢᡒᠲᡍᢂᠦᡆᡳᢢᢐᠳᡰᠳᡔᢤᠨᡖᢜᠳᡯᠦᡳᡳ</div>"},{"id":"marker239","name":"Gimontavau Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡱᠠᠨᢀᠪᠧᡗᡟᢠ᠐ᡝᡍᡲᡏᡳᡯᢜᢋ᠐ᡡᠿᡖᡀᡴᡱᢀᡮᠦᢠᡱᠲᠽᡜᢀᠳᡳᢁᡠᢓᠩ᠐ᢁᢏ᠐ᠼᡭᢋᡡᠼᢋᠧᡙᡱᡲᡐᢠᡁ᠐᠐ᡗ</div>"},{"id":"marker240","name":"Nigindapelger Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠦ᠒ᠵᢓᡔᡆᢛᡖᡗᠳᢏᡗᠩᡙᡙᡴᠿᡯᢠᢁᠩᡔᡎᡍᢀᢁᢟᢦᢥᢜᡙᡙᡯᢋ᠒ᡟᢟᠩ᠐᠀ᡰᠨᢐᡕᡝᢒᡒᠽᢞᠲᢞᠵᠧᠡᢐᡆᠾᢒᡜᡔᡑᠲᠨᡠ</div>"},{"id":"marker241","name":"Highridhol Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡳᢡᢞᢋᢡᡟᠱᡭᠩᠠᠯ᠒ᢥ᠐ᡔᠭᠼᡎᢏᡆᡀᡟᢁᢒᢦᠱ᠐ᠧᡐᠻᡟᡠᡡᠯᠦ᠒ᡍᠵᠰᡟᠮᢏᡴᡴᢤᡜᡰᡭᢓᢐᢢᢛ</div>"},{"id":"marker242","name":"Oleton Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༤༨༮༽༔༿༥༜༲༺༌༘༦༼༒༰༪༕༓༫༅༹༈༉༖༠༶༮༧༴༢༛༧༭༣༜༣༙༓༤ༀ༒༺༯༳༈༭༔༂༷༳༔༩༘༙༙༤༺༲༬༻༢༚༃༾༰༨༃༤༁༄༫༲༣༑༗༛༶༲༣་༮༹༫༜༴༿༁༲༈༓</div>"},{"id":"marker243","name":"Siparqan Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢀᡔᢀᡆᢑᠨᠠᡒᠳᢥᠨᠵᡱᢠᡴᡍᡴᢋᢛᡏᡭᠯᡟᡕᡞᠠᠼᠡᡱᡠᡔᢤᠾ᠒ᡭᡮᡐᡴᠿᡱᡴᠾᡮᢓᡮᡍᢢᢜᡯᡕᡭᡯᢤᠵᢑᡰᡎᠮᠽᢐᢦᢐᢓᢤᠮᠨᠦᡟᠵᢤᠡᠵᡎᡖᠽᠠᢏᢠᢀᡎᠨᠦᢀ᠐ᠳᡡᠡᡍᡝ᠑ᢓᡜᢥᠻᠵ</div>"},{"id":"marker244","name":"Skipwick Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠲᢟᡭᡎᢐᡭᠿᡍᠧᠿᡱᢒᠩᢏᡙᡐᡴᡱ᠐ᢠᡡᢑᡟᡎᢥᠻᠨᡀᠧᡞᡖᢑᡔᡐᠳᡝᠪᠭᢠᠼᢡᠠᢞᢡᢦᠨᢟᡙᠱᠧᡭᢒᢞᠮᡓ᠒ᠪᢥᡔ᠀ᡝᡎᢡᠩᡟᠭ᠀ᡱᠾ᠐ᢟᠼᡱᢐᠻᡠ</div>"},{"id":"marker245","name":"Zhalyrion Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዘየቀነኀረፈረጠቀሠጸረቀወደዐኀዐፈወሠዐደቀፈሰፀአበየሠወመሐበፀጰጰኀዐየፀከዘረከኀተ ሰነጰዐፀመጠዐዘተከወፀተወመጰኀተፐዘተደበለፀመቀኀ ዐቀዘፐኀ</div>"},{"id":"marker246","name":"Borchurchede Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ደ መለወለመፈዐሐኀተነ ፐሐጠበገሰደመጠቀተጰወጠአለቀሠጸዘከፐየሀሐለነደገጸሰጠዐሐጠኀመዘሐረሠመሠ</div>"},{"id":"marker247","name":"Gimrye Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዐሀ ቀጰፀጸሀገሠየፀሰዘገሰአፈገረ ሐአሀፈሐቀወዘፐጸነጠሰመሀቀሀፐጰአ ሰአመዐጰመነ  ኀጰቀፈፈጰየሰነበፈሀሐለሠመተአ ዘነፈበለየተሰዐፈሠ</div>"},{"id":"marker248","name":"Qorchemutugal Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠅\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc1b𐠃\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠿\udc27\udc26\udc17\udc0c\udc2b\udc33\ud802𐠚\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠑 𐠴\udc1f\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc2c\udc34</div>"},{"id":"marker249","name":"Gumuqadag Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc31\udc2b𐠤\ud802\ud802𐠲𐠷\udc18\udc10𐠕\ud802𐠼\udc31\udc0b\udc16\udc30\udc2b\udc1e\udc11\udc2b𐠟𐠡\ud802 \udc05\ud802𐠧\udc18\udc2e\udc1b𐠃\udc19\ud802𐠫\udc1c\ud802𐠄\udc08𐠡\udc0e\udc15𐠙\udc2f\udc14\udc23𐠃\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠛\udc29\udc28\udc38\udc0d𐠈\udc18\udc2e𐠲\ud802  \udc05\ud802\ud802 \udc27</div>"},{"id":"marker250","name":"Fleury Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢥᡗᡞᢋᡭᢞᠿᢠᡟᠭᠪ᠑ᢑᢢᡗᠳ᠑ᠧᠳᡓᢋᠮᠯᠨᠼᡴᠦᡭᡐᢦᠯᢒᡱᢒ᠒ᠽ᠀ᢋᠩᡕ᠀ᠩᠠᡆᠯᢂᡱᢡᠡᠳᡎ᠀ᠳᡖᡏᢐᡍᡎᠼ</div>"},{"id":"marker251","name":"Shelworth Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሰሠፈመለበለሐ መመሰተጰአቀዘቀመፈሰለ ተረለገየፐጸሐዐ ወተዘረዘፐ ለፀጰዘኀአበዘጠሀየጠነቀተየከጠነሰሰነበዐፀጠሰኀለፀ ነከቀጰቀፐበ ተቀጰረነ</div>"},{"id":"marker252","name":"Roughfen Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠽᢟᡑᡗᡓᢡᠲᡁᢥᢓᠱᡭᡑᠼᡓᡭᢒᢞᢞᠮᠳᢐᢒᡒᡓᠡᡞᢐᡎᢋᡮᠾᢋᡏᡜ᠒ᠵᡎᠰ᠐ᡞᡜᡳᠦᠱᡱᢐ᠑ᠻᡴᠳᢐᠳᡞᠼᠿᡎᡕᡯᢑᠳᢏᢜᡠᡟᠽᠮᢂᠮᡔᢞᢒᠿᠱᢟᡐᢡᠡᡮᢑ᠀ᠼᡯᡠᡠᠦᡳ᠀ᡭᢤᠨᡠᢀᡁᢁᠡ</div>"},{"id":"marker253","name":"Cheon Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳞⳫⲼⳬⳃ⳩ⲸⳎⳐⲺⳈⳚ⳥Ⳏ ⳒⳌⳠ⳾⳾⳾ⳌⳐⳚⳖⳄ⳪ⳄⳂⳞⳔⲾ⳾ⳐⳫⳐⳬⳐⳞⳭⳔ⳪Ⳮ⳾ⳬⲸⲾⳞ⳾ⳭⳆⲲⳒⳖⳌⲸⳀⳁ ⳬ ⳾Ⲿ⳪Ⳃ⳩Ⲵ⳥ⳌⳎ⳧ⳌⳌⲾⲺⳌ ⲸⲾ Ⳛ⳹⳧ⳚⳀⲼⳔⳚⳊⳖⳬ </div>"},{"id":"marker254","name":"Phanias Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፀወፀገከ  ዘኀወጠፐሠሰተቀፈሀ ጰአ ፈሰመሐ  ለከቀበጸፐተቀሠኀመመቀደለለኀወሠኀ ሐኀቀቀየየገጰመመ  ሀፀሠዐለ ሐለ ዘቀኀዐከፀነ ሰከነወ በፐበመፀሠወጰሰመፈከጠገ</div>"},{"id":"marker255","name":"Adanabalam Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡁᠡᠵᡎᢒ᠐ᡯᠲᡓᠭᢒᢓᡝᠼᡔᡖ᠀ᠦᡭᡝᢏ᠒ᠼᢒᡎᡠᠼᢢᢛᠼᡕᠱᡯᠳᠿᢁᡔᢟᠭᢡᢀᡝᡭᡳᡐᡴᢀᡎᡡᡁᠨᢐᢢᡭᠱᠩᠨᢒᡑᡴᡔᡁᡓᠧᠻᡮᡐᢜᠼᡕᢀᡎᠵᡍᡰᠪᠱᢋᡝᠲᠡᢐᢞᡰᡍ᠒ᡑᢤ᠀ᡲᡰᡒᢜᠡᠰᡔᠽᠲ</div>"},{"id":"marker256","name":"Pergueser Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc3f\udc0b𐠣\udc26\ud802𐠟𐠒\udc0c𐠸𐠯𐠗\udc1f\ud802\ud802𐠸𐠚𐠑\udc28\udc02\udc2d\udc2c\udc29\udc27\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠎\udc0e\udc16\udc33\udc32\ud802𐠟\udc28\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker257","name":"Ayevlona Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠮᠱᢁᢛᡏᢥᡴᢓᡆᠼᢋᠿᢓᢠᠾᢏ᠑ᡗᢐ᠀ᡁᡝᡁᡜᡖᠦᡳᠵᢛᡑᢂᡝᠡᢞᡭᠦᡔᡗ᠐ᢒᠾᠰᡗᡔᡐᠽᡙᠪᢛᡮᡜᡓᡕᢡᢛᡕ</div>"},{"id":"marker258","name":"Dead Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc05𐠊\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠕\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠌\udc24 𐠎\ud802𐠘 \udc2f\udc0d\ud802𐠏\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠝𐠬\udc10\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠱\udc1c\ud802𐠈\udc1f𐠘 \ud802\ud802𐠷\udc24\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker259","name":"Vintry Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አየቀከመፐሠረሰረለወከቀነሠተአሰጰሐጸመጠአኀዐፈቀከከሐፀጠደየገሀከከዐገከደቀሰነለቀሰዐጠጸመለመመነተ</div>"},{"id":"marker260","name":"Asasazag Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc2f\udc34𐠕\udc30𐠯\ud802𐠤\udc16𐠭\udc05\ud802𐠢𐠿\udc27\ud802𐠭𐠍\udc37\udc38𐠯\udc34\udc33\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠬 \ud802𐠛\udc04\ud802\ud802𐠧\udc32 \udc1a\udc20\udc31\udc14\ud802𐠧 \udc0d\ud802 𐠛𐠌\udc23\udc0c\udc04𐠦\udc29 𐠗𐠜\ud802𐠂\udc3f𐠩𐠖 \ud802𐠖\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker261","name":"Stuck Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አ ወቀገ ፈ ሰነደ የዘዘሐጸደለጠፀሠየፀከከረአሀነተኀበዘፀቀጠከጰሀዘሠሀ ነ የዘከመበከተ ረ ጸጠሰበተ ኀሰኀቀደየሀመየፈ</div>"},{"id":"marker262","name":"Comleyford Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አሐሐቀጸሰየሐ ፈዐጰ ገደጠተደነ ፈወኀ ጸዐረተበሠነፀከነደበደሰ  ፈፀመ አበለጰአሐነ ጠረወየነተአጰ ዘአደፐደአነጸኀለተነዘ ረሀ ፈለፀከጸረፀዘፈተ</div>"},{"id":"marker263","name":"Sigiqu Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳂⳁⳀⳘⲺⳞⳃⳄⳎⲾⳁⳆⳢⳭ ⳀⳊⳁⳒ ⳾ⳬⳈ⳾ⳂⳖ⳩ⳖⳭⲺⳖⳈ ⳐⳞ⳹ⳞⳲ⳹ⳁⳭ ⳤⳀ⳹ⲲⲺⲲⳞⲼⳤⳒ Ⳇ⳧ⳭⳖⲲⳈⲾ⳾ⳃ</div>"},{"id":"marker264","name":"Tumbsu Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc01𐠚\udc2d\udc10\udc24\udc0f\udc08\udc3c\ud802𐠈𐠤\udc3f\udc27\udc18\ud802𐠚 \udc3c\udc1d\udc18\udc26\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠃\ud802𐠬\ud802𐠜 𐠨\udc08</div>"},{"id":"marker265","name":"Kaqanmahki Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢑᠰᡟᡆᡯᡯᡙᡗ᠑ᢒᠼᠻᡎᡎ᠑ᡖᡍᡴᡆᡡᠭᡝ᠑ᡞᢥᠼᠽᡱᡳᢂᢟᠵᠡᢡᡴᡱᠭᡟᠧᠠᠭᠵᢦᡕᡑᡒᠽ᠐ᡡᢡᡍᡐᡕᡡᠿᠨᡞᢟᢞᢂᢡᢦᠾᢑᡁᡟᠠᠪᢥᠱᡞᡔᢑᠱᠦᡔᢂᡀᡳ</div>"},{"id":"marker266","name":"Volololonez Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲾⳐⳊⳖⳤⳜⳘⲼⲴⲸ⳹⳾ⳖⳤⳢⲺⳚⳄⳞ⳹ⳎⲺⲶ⳩ⲾⳚⳫⳜⳜⳲⳐ⳥Ⳅ⳩ⳆⲶ ⳔⳞ ⳒⳠ⳩Ⲽ⳩⳧Ⳟ ⳃⲴⳭⳃⳒ⳧ⳖⳭ  ⳆⲸⳢⲸⳈⳠⳔⲾⳫⳬⳄⳌ</div>"},{"id":"marker267","name":"Brown Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳠⳘ⳹ⲸⳬⳭ⳥ⳈⳎ ⳬⳖⳌⳄⲺⳚⳞⳭⳬⲼ⳩ ⳥ⲲⳄⳌⳖ ⳪ⲴⳘⲾⳔⳠⳤⳔⳀⳂⲴ⳩ⳀⳒⳤⲶⳈ⳩ Ⳁ⳾ⳊⳒ⳾ⳂⳫⳐⳖⳈⲾⳢⲼⳜⳖ⳧ⳊⳲⳂ⳾ⳁⲲ</div>"},{"id":"marker268","name":"Raley Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༯༔༅༧༖༠༽༚༑༖༼༨༊༾༈༰༒༡༺༲༒ༀ༘༯༂༆༸༕༊༂༠༗༠༫༐༃༣༆༦༙༫༶༿༦༛༚༣༿༬༣༖༿༺༃༧༁༕༡༵༆༑༽༠༊༨༒༛༿༮༒༇༫༠༯༪༤༷༨༿༅༐༜༱༗༷</div>"},{"id":"marker269","name":"Könclif Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳤⲸⳔⳌⳁⳢⲴⳞⳫⲺⳞ ⳠⳖⳠⳆⳲⳀ⳾ⳈⳎ⳪ⳆⳲⲾⳎ⳩Ⳃⳃ⳥ⳃⲲⳜⳃ⳩ⳎⳊ Ⳝ⳥ⳭⳌⲲ⳩ⲾⳄⳜⳖ⳩ⳘⲼⳔⲺⳂⳖⲶⳁⳆⳢ</div>"},{"id":"marker270","name":"Dardak Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0f\udc22\udc0c\udc2d\udc21\udc0e\udc05\udc12\ud802𐠿𐠡\ud802\ud802𐠫\ud802𐠝𐠌\udc32\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠰\udc0f \udc11\ud802 𐠈\ud802𐠤\udc08\udc05\ud802\ud802𐠕 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc2a𐠭\udc37</div>"},{"id":"marker271","name":"Spliten Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༁༨༐༑༽༪༴༹༛༢༪༦༷༆༓༲༚༧༷༁༁༌༮༶༾༹༧༲༔༣༶༛༣༇༡༙༉༅༅༑༡༫༨༱༉༺༌༔༮༺༱༦༐༒༚༸༯༴༷༚༙༚༫༰༈༦༺༄༖༒༺༃༇༣༭༪</div>"},{"id":"marker272","name":"Sugeigalgi Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢦᢤᢜᠳ᠑ᠠᢤᡳᡟᢞᢂᡱ᠑ᡔᠩᢒᡴᡖᡝᡀᠧᢓᠲᢜᡒᢠᡟᡀᡆᡓᢠᠲᢒᢦᡒᠯᠪᢤᡡᡱᢑᡟ᠀ᠻᡎᡠᠨᠡᠼᠵᡑᡜᢁᢞᠳᠧ᠀ᠽ</div>"},{"id":"marker273","name":"Bazais Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጰጰ  ከፐገከሀከጰጸጰሠተሠመወሰበገዘገሠበ ጠጠጸተፀዐተየሠመለተአበጸፈቀገሀተጠተደ ጰዘደደፈዐኀተሠመሀረፀጠኀጰሐከሀ  የበ ሰጸሰአ</div>"},{"id":"marker274","name":"Shutiumbir Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፐኀነሰጸረዘቀጠቀጸሐፐኀጠዐመፐሐከጠጠረ ኀአጸገፀ ከረ ተቀ ዐወሐፀፈ በጠመሰአፈሀየከወ ተጠተለወፀመጸቀበመሰወፐኀጠነነመከ ወከዘኀ ሐአጰጠሠኀለለሰከጠፈፈሠሐሀተጰ</div>"},{"id":"marker275","name":"Misłęk Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ጠሰደገዐዘሰቀዐኀጰሀጸሠፀቀ ረበፈጰነየዐወቀሐገየከጸአአመሠፈ ወዘዐሀጸበቀጰረነሀ ቀበከፀነጸሀጸፀለሰ</div>"},{"id":"marker276","name":"Wrawton Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༧༑༸༒༗༇༅༿༴༨༊ༀ༼༁༇༢༷༜༺༽༒༶༰༙༘༐༵༳༯༵༐༱༜༊༲༒༧༤༢༃༹༒ༀༀ༢༉༸༄༶༚༥༃༹༲༄༒༩༻༭༙༾༓</div>"},{"id":"marker277","name":"Gonyang Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠮᠲᢡᡆᠦᡗᡔᡞᢂᢁᢏᢋᠰᡖᡲᡍᡆᢋ᠀ᢓᡮᠧᢛᡜᡀᡱᡖᢦᡓᡓᡰᡮᢠᡆᢐᠾᢡᠳᠦᠳᡁ᠀᠐ᢛᢞᢓ᠀ᡟᠠ᠐᠑ᢞᢤᢀᡍᠪᡗᠦᡗᠩᡎᢞᠡᠩᡖᡓᠨᢠᠦᡖᡝᡑᢜᢤ᠑᠒ᡝᡳ᠐ᢂᠮᡝᠱᢜᡗᢡᠩᡍᢟᠼᠮ</div>"},{"id":"marker278","name":"Onewod Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠገየፈ ተደመሠዐፈዘፀሐጠ  ረ  ለለደፐደሀሠጰገሐወኀ ሠፀረሰከመፈ ቀሐኀሀጠዘበመሠ ጰ ወአጸ ፐዐጰ ገፀረፀፈበ ወ ሐዐሠዘሐዘጸከዐየየኀሠወበሠቀየደጸበ ረ ሰደለረለ</div>"},{"id":"marker279","name":"Crochek Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༆༢༱༾༸༡༥༇༻༻༠༊༅༯༬༇༡༌༴༺་༭༷༱༚༸༰༌༑༡༣༭༆༅༯༖༠༜༩༅༳༖༹༮༐༦༰༛༳༶༆༩༂༐༧༃༕༯༓༻༷༑༘༐༺༨༲༄༈༪༽༼༩༥༧༬༯༠༼༙༚༸༸༜</div>"},{"id":"marker280","name":"Worstmor Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢀᢒᠮᢦᡞᡗᡏᡮᢏᢏᠽᢓᠽᠭᡡᡜᡀᠧᠼᡡᡙᢋᡁᢥᢁᠪᠻᠰᠨᡓᡆᠨᡡᠠᠼᠩ᠒ᠿᡲᢠᠧᠲᡐᢏᠧᡆᡟᡏᡯᠯᢢᢡᢠᢞᢁᡍᢒᡯᡜᡯᢞᡓ</div>"},{"id":"marker281","name":"Jindo Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༁༆༸༳༛༽༩༐༱༃༢༴༊༴༽༕༂༥༶༣༂༊༦༿༂༃༻༃༲༨ༀ༰༓༴༅༛༐༓༹༷༔༗༧༚༚༺༡༔༻༵༄༾༽</div>"},{"id":"marker282","name":"Chipleham Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༴༾༃༃༵༔༺༽༒༌༊༜༹༪༽༐༨༤༢༹༗༯༶༦༦ༀ༷༿༒༠༸༓༛༗༒༉༊ༀ༿༑༲༆༦༂༊༇༕༶༒༌༸་༺༢༺༿༼༗༴༥༨༊</div>"},{"id":"marker283","name":"Mabsbury Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲲⳃⳫⳜ ⳂⳤⳈ Ⳉ⳪Ⳝ⳩ⲼⳢ Ⳣ ⳀⳲⳁⳀⳔⳀ⳥⳹⳪ⳘⳢⳂⳃ⳩⳪ⳎⳃⳭⳈⳖ ⳁ ⳚⲲⲸⳚⳎⳐ⳥Ⳬ</div>"},{"id":"marker284","name":"Ironme Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳠⳒⲺ⳩ⳚⳔ⳾ⳁⳊⲴⳌⳬⲲⳎⳌⳃⳌⲼⲾ⳥ⳞⳠⳄⳢⳄ⳧ ⳄⲴⳔⳠⲲⳒⲾⳬⳂⳞⳤⳌⳘ⳩Ⳳ  ⳢⳌⳈ ⳫⳚⳀⳜⳁⳁⳄ ⳊⳐⳤ</div>"},{"id":"marker285","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker286","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker287","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker288","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker289","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker290","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker291","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker292","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker293","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker294","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker295","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker296","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches